Debian support, ported from Debian 0.111-1 01_debian-support.patch and
03_no-launchpad.patch (Matthias Klumpp). Debian has no ubuntu-drivers-common
and no dh-translations: hide the drivers tab and build without them.
Show the snap line only when snap is installed.

